# Audio files: keep all by default — pruning is handled by the
# workflow's 'cleanup old audio' step which removes > 14-day-old
# directories before commit. The 14-day cap keeps repo size sane
# (~25 MB / 14 days at 1.7 MB per day).
# (No audio/ entries ignored here — we WANT the recent ones committed.)
